  "title": "Cranberry Chocolate Orange Muffins",
  "description": "Dried cranberries are plumped up in boiling water and mixed with an easy muffin batter laced with fragrant orange zest and chocolate chips.",
  "authors": [
    "Sarah-May"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:17:12-05:00",
